               "summary":  "CRWD fell 5.76% to $229.44 on 20 Nov 2026, mainly because of the AI-sector selloff and profit-taking after a rally sparked by Palo Alto Networks\u0027 results. After the close, reports of talks to buy Zscaler added another 8% drop after hours. The technicals are neutral: the long-term EMAs are still bullishly stacked, but price is below the EMA50 and volume confirmed the selling. The business looks healthy, with ARR up 25%. The moat thesis moves to \u0027watch\u0027 because a Zscaler deal would test the single-platform story. The next key event is Q3 results on 1 Dec."
